From f58ba480942e91ad7a0a43158a9c57496acc202a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: vince <vincepaul.liem@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 14:56:32 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] feat(storage): configure bounded namespace and data capacity

Allocate namespace and backing metadata in bounded supervisor mappings.
Charge page-rounded metadata before file bytes, expose explicit object/data
limits, and retain small inline VFS defaults and shared open positions.

Signed-off-by: vince <vincepaul.liem@gmail.com>
